    "chunk_text": "sende to heofnum. AU10A15 Ond on \u00e6fentid Iustinus se m\u00e6ssepreost ond Ypolitus, se cristena tungerefa, unrote ond AU11A1 On \u00f0one XIan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00fees bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s halgan weres gemind sancti Tiburtii. AU11A2 Se w\u00e6s in Rome, ond swi\u00fee late he wolde onfon Cristes gelefan ond fulwihte ond AU11A7 Ond he w\u00e6s si\u00f0\u00fean swa fulfremed in Godes gelefan \u00f0\u00e6t, gif he song his credon o\u00f0\u00f0e AU11A10 Ac \u00fea w\u00e6s sum swi\u00f0e facenful mon in Rome, se w\u00e6s in noman Torquatris se geypte AU12A1 On \u00f0one XIIan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00fees bi\u00f0 sancti Euplis \u00ferowung. AU12A2 Se b\u00e6r Cri\u00fees godspel in fodre ofer his sculdrum swa hw\u00e6der swa he eode. AU12A3 Ond he \u00fea com in \u00fea ceastre \u00fee is nemned Catinentia ond he eode in \u00fe\u00e6t domern \u00f0\u00e6r \u00f0\u00e6r AU12A6 \u00dea untynde Eplius \u00fe\u00e6t Cristes godspel, ond s\u00e6de \u00feam folce hw\u00e6t \u00fea halgan godspelleras AU12A9 Ond \u00fea for\u00feon yrsode se dema ond het hine beheafdian. AU12A11 Ond \u00fea he w\u00e6s l\u00e6ded to \u00fe\u00e6re \u00ferowunge, \u00fea ontynde se heofon, ond he geseah urne AU13A1 On \u00f0one XIIIan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00fees bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feroweres gemynd sancti Ypoliti. AU13A2 Se was tungerefa on Rome, ac he gelyfde gode \u00feurh \u00fea wundor \u00fee he geseah \u00e6t sancti",
